ghost-role-information-n14pet-eyebot-tribe-name = Tribal Eyebot Companion
ghost-role-information-n14pet-eyebot-tribe-description =
    You are a follower of someone, obey them and attempt to protect them. In-case they perish you may continue to serve the tribe.
    You have a knife strapped onto your chassis, which others can apply reagents onto. Be careful entering melee though, as you're quite fragile!

ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-eyebot-osi-name = OSI Eyebot Companion
ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-eyebot-osi-description =
    You are an NCR Office of Science and Industry support Eyebot. Follow and protect the OSI personnel who deployed you.
    Your calibrated laser is for defending the research team; its charge is limited and recharges slowly.

# #Misfits Add - Enclave Eyebot pet ghost role (issued to Enclave scientists)
ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-eyebot-enclave-name = Enclave Eyebot Companion
ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-eyebot-enclave-description =
    You are an Enclave support Eyebot, a re-chassied pre-war unit in service to the Enclave's scientific division.
    Follow and protect the Enclave scientist who deployed you. Your laser is for defending the research team; its charge is limited and recharges slowly.

# #Misfits Add - Enclave Cyberdog pet ghost role (purchasable by Enclave scientists)
ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-dog-enclave-name = Enclave Cyberdog
ghost-role-information-misfits-pet-dog-enclave-description =
    You are an Enclave cybernetic dog, a loyal and obedient killing machine.
    Follow and protect the Enclave scientist who deployed you. Your bite is your weapon; you're fast and tough, but still a dog.
ghost-role-information-zax-unit-name = Z.A.X Unit
ghost-role-information-zax-unit-description = A Z.A.X-linked robotic chassis. You are connected to the Z.A.X command network and operate as one of its field units.
ghost-role-information-zax-unit-rules = You are linked to Z.A.X. Follow Z.A.X directives and preserve Z.A.X assets unless higher-priority server rules apply.
